-  "temp_q2_answer": "Isticmaal qaacidada kor lagu muujiyay: waxay ku lug leedahay isku dhufasho iyo isku darid/ka-jarid labadaba, sababtoo ah labada heerkul ee la beddelayo ma wadaagaan bar-eber isku mid ah.",
